Z||000005||pherder||03-23-2000||06:56 PM||||I have purchased almost everything Rodney has sold!<P>A couple of years ago, I put gas struts on my Ferrari 308 kit to hold up the extremely heavy trunk lid.  <P>Some how, Rodney and I talked about it and Rodney picked my brain clean of what cylinders I used, where I placed them, etc.<P>As you can easily see, Rodney now sells several versions of the decklid strut kits.<P>You know what I have on my 88 Fiero Coupe?  YUP!  A Rodney Dickman decklid strut!  Rodney's pieces are of MUCH higher quality that I could come up with so I bought Rodney's instead of trying to come up with another set of my own.<P>I have his tools, his FWD Getrag kit, his decals, his water pipe replacement for my auto 88 V6, his splash guards, etc.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>And yes, I will purchase more from him when ever he brings out a new "product".<P>Paul||||reg||14
